5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,792
Look! Three brought a microphone!

6
00:00:21,792 --> 00:00:25,333
One, two, three! Welcome to the zoo show!

7
00:00:26,417 --> 00:00:29,083
Three, check the sky before we start.

8
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:32,708
Blue sky! No clouds today.

9
00:00:34,792 --> 00:00:36,083
How’s the weather?

10
00:00:36,583 --> 00:00:38,083
It’s sunny today.

11
00:00:38,417 --> 00:00:39,958
Yoonsu, your turn.

12
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:41,833
It’s sunny today.

13
00:00:48,792 --> 00:00:50,042
What is your name?

14
00:00:50,542 --> 00:00:51,958
I am Yoonsu.

15
00:00:52,292 --> 00:00:53,833
Yoonsu, your turn.

16
00:00:54,208 --> 00:00:55,625
I am Yoonsu.

17
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:05,750
Count my blocks. One, two, three!

18
00:01:06,833 --> 00:01:09,667
For our zoo play, I’m three years old.

19
00:01:10,750 --> 00:01:14,500
Try Three’s answer. Later, use your own age.

20
00:01:16,792 --> 00:01:18,125
How old are you?

21
00:01:18,625 --> 00:01:19,875
I am three.

22
00:01:20,208 --> 00:01:21,750
Yoonsu, your turn.

23
00:01:22,125 --> 00:01:23,375
I am three.

24
00:01:29,792 --> 00:01:30,958
Where do you go?

25
00:01:31,458 --> 00:01:32,542
To the zoo!

26
00:01:32,875 --> 00:01:34,417
Yoonsu, your turn.

27
00:01:34,792 --> 00:01:35,875
To the zoo!

28
00:01:42,792 --> 00:01:45,500
I go to the zoo. Who’s on stage?

29
00:01:46,583 --> 00:01:50,292
A chicken and a duck! Listen to their sounds.

30
00:01:51,375 --> 00:01:53,458
Cluck, cluck! Quack, quack!

31
00:01:55,792 --> 00:01:57,500
Who says cluck, cluck?

32
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,333
It’s a chicken.

33
00:01:59,667 --> 00:02:01,208
Yoonsu, your turn.

34
00:02:01,583 --> 00:02:02,917
It’s a chicken.

35
00:02:09,792 --> 00:02:11,542
Who says quack, quack?

36
00:02:12,042 --> 00:02:13,167
It’s a duck.

37
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,042
Yoonsu, your turn.

38
00:02:15,417 --> 00:02:16,542
It’s a duck.

39
00:02:23,792 --> 00:02:27,333
Time for our dream song. I’ll count us in!

40
00:02:27,958 --> 00:02:29,417
One, two, three!

41
00:02:30,042 --> 00:02:31,375
I have a dream.

42
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,625
I like to sing a song.

43
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:36,042
So I want to be a singer.

44
00:02:37,792 --> 00:02:39,958
What do you like to do on stage?

45
00:02:40,458 --> 00:02:41,750
I like singing.

46
00:02:42,083 --> 00:02:43,625
Yoonsu, your turn.

47
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,292
I like singing.

48
00:02:51,792 --> 00:02:53,208
What do you want to be?

49
00:02:53,708 --> 00:02:55,083
A singer, too!

50
00:02:55,417 --> 00:02:56,958
Yoonsu, your turn.

51
00:02:57,333 --> 00:02:58,708
A singer, too!

52
00:03:05,792 --> 00:03:09,500
The singers are hungry. Who has a second dream?

53
00:03:10,583 --> 00:03:12,458
I also want to be a cook.

54
00:03:13,542 --> 00:03:16,750
Here’s a pot. Let’s make soup for the show!

55
00:03:18,792 --> 00:03:20,542
What else do you want to be?

56
00:03:21,042 --> 00:03:22,333
A cook, too!

57
00:03:22,667 --> 00:03:24,208
Yoonsu, your turn.

58
00:03:24,583 --> 00:03:25,875
A cook, too!

59
00:03:32,792 --> 00:03:34,708
What shall we make together?

60
00:03:35,208 --> 00:03:36,750
Let’s make soup.

61
00:03:37,083 --> 00:03:38,625
Yoonsu, your turn.

62
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,542
Let’s make soup.

63
00:03:48,250 --> 00:03:51,125
Who wants to ask a friend about their dream?

64
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:53,708
My hand is up!

65
00:03:54,917 --> 00:03:58,458
Go ahead, Yoonsu. Pass the question to Three.

66
00:03:59,583 --> 00:04:00,958
How about you?

67
00:04:02,792 --> 00:04:04,667
Ask Three about her dream.

68
00:04:05,167 --> 00:04:06,542
How about you?

69
00:04:06,875 --> 00:04:08,417
Yoonsu, your turn.

70
00:04:08,792 --> 00:04:10,167
How about you?

71
00:04:16,792 --> 00:04:18,917
Me? I want to sing with you!

72
00:04:19,458 --> 00:04:20,833
I have a dream.

73
00:04:21,375 --> 00:04:23,083
I like to sing a song.

74
00:04:23,625 --> 00:04:25,417
So I want to be a singer.

75
00:04:25,958 --> 00:04:27,958
I also want to be a cook.

76
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:29,875
How about you?

77
00:04:31,792 --> 00:04:34,125
Hi! This is my zoo picture.

78
00:04:35,208 --> 00:04:37,833
