81
00:04:47,458 --> 00:04:48,750
I am happy.

82
00:04:49,083 --> 00:04:50,625
Yoonsu, your turn.

83
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,292
I am happy.

84
00:04:58,792 --> 00:05:01,042
A big hand for our dream show!

85
00:05:02,833 --> 00:05:06,875
I heard you sing, and I heard your question.

86
00:05:07,417 --> 00:05:09,000
The duck sang along!

87
00:05:09,542 --> 00:05:12,208
Quack, quack! I love you, too.
